      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altus%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The arrival of the Kansas City, Mexico and Orient Railway in 1908 spurred Altus into a regional agricultural hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altus%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Altus Air Force Base, home to C‑17, KC‑46 and KC‑135 crews, makes the city a key U.S. Air Force training center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
